# Calendar Config

## Calendar ID

> Your Google Calendar ID. Find it in Google Calendar → Settings → your calendar → "Calendar ID".
> Example: `yourname@gmail.com` or `abc123xyz@group.calendar.google.com`

{{CALENDAR_ID}}

## Sync Range

> Default range used by `calendardeck-sync` when no explicit range is given.
> Examples: `current-month`, `next-30-days`, `2026-06-01–2026-06-30`

{{SYNC_RANGE}}

